      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Conditions (checked in order):\n1. vibe_passed == True\n   → END (vibe is acceptable)\n2. vibe_attempts > MAX_VIBE_ATTEMPTS\n   → END (hard limit reached)\n3. otherwise (bad vibe)\n   → agent (retry with feedback)",
